paragraph start
name: paragraph-d4-blocks
Rule: almost every part of this feature is a block type file. A
time kind is a block, a repeat kind is a block, a timer kind is a
block and a mark kind is a block. A part that is not a block breaks
the system. Formulas stay only a field inside a block.
