paragraph start
name: paragraph-d4-marks-link
A mark is stored once and shown everywhere by links. Marking a
file in a layout or in the file itself, by hand, by code or by the
runfile system, gives the same result: it appears in both. Nothing
is copied. Why: one source, every place reads it.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
