paragraph start
name: paragraph-d4-marks-dir
Mark kinds live in a marks subfolder of .runfile, apart from the
block types. The default kinds are in the default runfile folder.
Users add their own in .runfile/marks. The indexer reads that
subfolder.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
