paragraph start
name: paragraph-d4-progress
Progress loads only from the worktree. Taps write the progress file
in the worktree without a commit, and the commit happens when he
stops the chain. Why: the history is not filled with small steps
and a wipe of tmp loses nothing. The tmp scratch file is not used.
