paragraph start
name: paragraph-d5-surfaces
The walk runs everywhere in sync: the shell, a TUI inside the
editor and the web page. It can be started from any of them and he
can switch between them. It runs from keys first, and also from
mouse, buttons and touch on the web page. The key map is editable.
The web start needs its own plan, with the web dashboard.
