paragraph start
name: paragraph-d5-order
Chains stay in one straight line. A step of another chain that
falls due while one runs, such as an hourly step during a work
chain, merges into that line by time. There are no lanes.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
