paragraph start
name: paragraph-d5-web
The web interface is made of boxes, like the rest of the
ecosystem, and every setting is reachable there. The settings TUI
is the same on the web page, because the terminal multiplexer is
planned as an interface for the web page and renders everything
inside it. The page layout waits for its own plan. Charts are not
default. The option stays open and a chart reads the numbers that
already live in the steps.
