paragraph start
name: paragraph-d5-folders
Folders for block types. Marks, times, repeats and timers each get
a folder of their own, in the default runfile folder and in the
nearest .runfile folder. Why: they are different things from
content block types and the user adds more in the same place. The
indexer and both block registries must read these folders.
