paragraph start
name: paragraph-d5-notes
Notes. He takes notes in real time while he walks. A note is for a
hole or an idea that must not stop the chain. Notes go to a notes
file of the chain, or of the whole nested chain. At the end he is
asked whether to keep the file. A kept file goes to the todo, so a
note becomes work. A note links to its step by the instance id.
Notes need their own planning and settings. Example: a gap seen in
an original is noted now and fixed later.
