paragraph start
name: paragraph-d6-notes
Notes live in the worktree next to the chain file, uncommitted,
while the chain runs. At the end a pop-up asks whether to send the
notes to the todo. Kept notes go to a separate todo notes file in
the root, so he returns to normal work with the todo ready. Why: a
note usually means something must change. Open: whether he picks
notes one by one.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
