answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d6-formula
Measure formulas stay small and modular. The core is numbers and
the four operations, and every further operator is added as its own
part, including plus and minus steps that count up in increments.
The server computes them and the editor and the web page ask it.
contract start
id: q1deb06
