paragraph start
name: paragraph-d6-surfaces
Every surface has the same format and the server is behind all of
them. The web page is for accessibility and for its stronger
graphics, not for different features. The walk can be started from
any surface.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
