paragraph start
name: paragraph-d6-worktrees
Every instance gets its own git worktree: a tutorial, a workout, a
test, each separate. Why: the book repo stays small to navigate and
each instance commits alone. The server picks the repo from the
folder of the file and gives a clear error when no repo owns it.
