paragraph start
name: paragraph-d7-names
The names, from the netrunner idea. The whole feature is netrun. A
guided doing is a run. One step stays a step. A group of steps in a
run is a stack. Starting and stopping a run is jack in and jack
out. The progress log is the ledger. The full-screen step view is
the screen. A level stays a level. The ecosystem becomes subnet,
and the operating system is subnet OS. Why: one brand for every
part.
