Holes left, small ones for the build. One: how many sandboxes may
exist and how an old one is closed. Two: how a sandbox branch is
kept apart or merged. Three: the loader for the folders of mark,
time, repeat and timer block types. Four: one schema for the same
form in the file, the settings TUI and the web page. The web page
layout has its own plan and the dashboard comes last. The build
order is asked next.
